# Deliberately no VITE_API_BASE_URL here: in production, nginx reverse-proxies the Go API on the
# same origin as the frontend (see ../deploy/nginx/stationsignal.conf), so apiClient.ts's
# window.location.origin fallback is correct regardless of whether the app is opened via
# http://stationsignal.internal or a bare http://<box-ip> — hardcoding one hostname here broke
# the other.
